---
import Container from "./Container.astro"

---

<div id="about">
  <Container>
    <h2 class="mb-4 my-8 text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-gray-700 dark:text-white md:text-4xl">
      About Me
    </h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 lg:gap-8 items-center">  
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-2 md:col-span-2" style="--delay:150ms">
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-justify text-base leading-relaxed">
          Computer Science graduate with hands-on experience as a Managed Service Engineer, supporting the migration of more than 3,200 laptops and PCs to a new company domain. Experienced in checking device readiness, troubleshooting login and user profile issues, and providing technical support to ensure a smooth transition with minimal disruption to users.
          I also have experience in IT support, UI/UX design, front-end development, application maintenance, graphic design, and marketing. I enjoy learning new things, solving technical problems, working with others, and helping users find practical solutions. I am adaptable, collaborative, and committed to providing reliable and user-friendly support.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal flex justify-center lg:justify-end" style="--delay:150ms">
        <img src="/images/gotama.jpg" class="rounded-full aspect-square w-64 max-w-xs lg:max-w-sm object-cover shadow-lg" alt="profile photo" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</div>